  note    = {arXiv:2404.11550 (Lett. Math. Phys. version exists; cite the arXiv for the full statements). Defines modular resurgent series: when the Borel plane carries a single infinite tower of singularities, the Stokes constants are the coefficients of an L-function and the median resummation is governed by a quantum modular form (Zagier). Bridges quantum modularity and resurgence; sequel arXiv:2506.08265 (q-Pochhammer / mirror curves). For QOU: the structural template under which the even-face Borel action and the odd-face Stokes constants would be two shadows of one quantum-modular object — the test posed by the modular-resurgence probe in the alien-calculus ↔ surreal integration review (2026-07-13).},
